<title>USA: Dow off more than 100 points.</title>
<headline>Dow off more than 100 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average lost more than 100 points in mid-morning trading Friday on a broad selloff in technology stocks.</p>
<p>At 10:32 a.m. EDT the Dow index was down 102.20 points at 7,918.57.</p>
